					"content": "嘘…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031006,
					"content": "再细说下去，就是我的「小秘密」的范围了哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031007,
					"content": "好了，你们不如去跑一趟吧。让那小鬼别再吓人了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031008,
					"content": "这可不是差使你们——正如那位仙人所说，人的灵魂不如仙人强韧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031009,
					"content": "为了接触仙人时不受伤害，就从接触小鬼开始锻炼吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031010,
						10031012
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031010,
					"content": "我没问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031011
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10031011,
					"content": "但要怎么劝说鬼魂呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031013,
					"content": "客栈里有一幅字画，描摹了璃月通行千年的「降魔印」，你们可以去看看它的样子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031014
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031014,
					"content": "——然后，就在这间客栈附近，寻找「能够见到完整降魔印的地方」吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "菲尔戈黛特"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031012,
					"content": "但要怎么劝说鬼魂呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031013
					]
				}
			]
