					"nextDialogs": [
						10031706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031706,
					"content": "岩王帝君…竟遭此厄。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031707,
					"content": "我…无法想象。不论时代如何变易，我都从未想象过失去帝君的璃月之地。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031708,
					"content": "掌管人间的七星…究竟在这件事里扮演了怎样的角色？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031709,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031710,
					"content": "我会去找削月、理水、留云三位真君。他们也是时候作出决断了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031711,
						10031712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031711,
					"content": "仙人会来接管璃月吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031713
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10031713,
					"content": "仙人不会逃避责任。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031714,
					"content": "虽然…我有不愿沾染凡尘的理由，但职责终归是职责。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031715,
					"content": "因为我们的神，乃是「契约」之神。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031716
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031716,
					"content": "等一下！我还有最后一个问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031717,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031718
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031718,
					"content": "那个…小冥…究竟是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031719,
					"content": "降妖除魔时，偶尔也会遇到从未害过人的恶灵，又暂时难以超度。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031720,
					"content": "所以拜托「老板」与「掌柜」，收留一段时日。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10031721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10031721,
					"content": "原来是望舒客栈帮忙养着的啊——！这家客栈的业务范围也太广了吧？！",
